7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GgrZcTn-4OkQ7kNvwHZfV4-&_nc_oc=Adpm79Ro-VuRheZBYyOnP451nmpVUNwG2Q98x-Ws_cMULaXjQkOYO7B2dHIcybQGlCg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af36xTSe7eB3QZAdU_kfPuX16b9eESiTinv46__vSL8Gng&oe=69F202B3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "New_Project_3.png", "id": "1686683892204452", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391893_1686683895537785_2742684447871003937_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Wu6aowdHB_oQ7kNvwEi-zQ-&_nc_oc=Adpwcx5TzB5rX8IyFjxPyRt9IW73AXPN9K31wZwF7lY1HhFsquIvxjizEXcQvNcEKeE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3qMs63H7HBtx5sWjTmsrjdZ1trm_qLYKzyspfOdLqLOQ&oe=69F1F7A9"}, "display_name": "Monkey Hub VR", "keywords": ["MonkeyHub", "Tag", "Gorilla", "Monkey", "Fangame"], "long_description": "Welcome to Monkey Hub VR!\nMonkey Hub VR is an immersive social hub with tons off fun game modes and maps such as Monke Games a crab game inspired game mode featuring unique Korean children's games or the horror mode were you break into the subliminal side of Monkey Hub VR and fight the mysterious entities.\n\nExperience a world like no other with not just your self but up to 10 players. Monkey Hub VR is a huge world with much to offer and is a place for everyone to let out there inner monkey! \ud83d\udc35 \n\nWith immersive VR gameplay, chaotic fun, and high-stakes challenges, Monkey Hub VR will push your skills to the limit.", "short_description": "Welcome to Monkey Hub VR!\nMonkey Hub VR is an immersive social hub with tons off fun game modes and maps such as Monke Games a crab game inspired game mode featuring unique Korean children's games or the horror mode were you break into the subliminal side of Monkey Hub VR and fight the mysterious entities.\n\nExperience a world like no other with not just your self but up to 10 players. Monkey Hub VR is a huge world with much to offer and is a place for everyone."}]}, "developer_name